UID:http://calagator.org/events/1250482547
DESCRIPTION:Come join your fellow idealists\, builders\, and shitposters 
 for another meetup about the atmosphere! Together\, we’re doing our part
  to create a more social web so the internet belongs to The People and n
 ot the oligarchs.&#13\;\n&#13\;\nCo-organizer Brittany Ellich will give 
 us a preview of the AT Proto 101 talk she’s presenting at [CascadiaJS Ju
 ne 2nd](https://cascadiajs.com/) - including a raffle for a ✨ free ticke
 t to the conference ✨. And\, since we got lots of love re: the open\, co
 llaborative style of our last meetup\, we’re doing it again!&#13\;\n&#13
 \;\n**How it will work:**&#13\;\n&#13\;\n- [@BrittanyEllich.com](https:/
 /bsky.app/profile/brittanyellich.com) \, will kick the meeting off with 
 her AT Proto talk\, including:&#13\;\n  - The problem with social media&
 #13\;\n  - What is the atmosphere?&#13\;\n  - Overview of DIDs/lexicons/
 etc&#13\;\n  - How we can get involved&#13\;\n- We’ll ask for 3 -4 volun
 teers to lead a discussion group&#13\;\n- Then\, we’ll break out into hu
 ddles\, and everyone can join their chosen discussion group&#13\;\n&#13\
 ;\n**Example discussion ideas:**&#13\;\n&#13\;\n- How to Make ATProto No
 rmie-Friendly&#13\;\n- Here’s how I built XYZ&#13\;\n- My Experience Wor
 king on ATProto as an Absolute Beginner&#13\;\n- Let’s Discuss: Getting 
 Funding for Our Projects&#13\;\n&#13\;\n**Agenda:**&#13\;\n&#13\;\n- 6:0
 0 - 6:10 (ish) | Snacks\, hangout\, shooting the shit\, whatevs&#13\;\n-
  6:10 - 6:40 (ish) | AT Protocol 101 by Brittany Ellich&#13\;\n- 6:40 - 
 6:45 (ish) | Discussion huddle ideas&#13\;\n- 6:45 - 7:15 (ish) | Huddle
  breakout&#13\;\n- 7:15 - 7:30 | Regroup and discuss&#13\;\n- 7:30 | Clo
 se\, announce raffle winner\, and after-hangout at a nearby bar&#13\;\n&
 #13\;\nSpecial thanks to [@jason.energy](https://bsky.app/profile/jason.
 energy) for offering his CodeTV studio for our meetup space!&#13\;\nHope
  to see you all there!\n\nImported from: http://calagator.org/events/125
 0482547
URL:https://platform.openmeet.net/events/atproto-pdx-ckrem2
SUMMARY:ATProto 101 + Hangout with your favorite ATmosphere nerds!
LOCATION:CodeTV studio: 1551 SE Poplar Avenue\, Portland OR 97214 United 
 States
SEQUENCE:1
END:VEVENT
