UID:http://calagator.org/events/1250482560
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our very first Gresham Vibecoders Meetup! We'll k
 ick things off with introductions — who you are\, what you're building (
 only if you want to share)\, and what tools you're using. From there\, w
 e'll do an open show-and-tell where anyone can demo a project they've be
 en working on\, no matter how finished (or unfinished) it is. We'll swap
  tips\, talk about what's working\, what's broken\, and what we're figur
 ing out as we go.&#13\;\n&#13\;\nExpect good conversation\, a few laughs
 \, and maybe a spark for your next build. Come as you are — beginner\, b
 uilder\, or just AI-curious. All are welcome!\n\nTags: meetup\, Vibecodi
 ng\n\nImported from: http://calagator.org/events/1250482560
URL:https://www.meetup.com/gresham-vibecoders/events/314634192/
SUMMARY:Gresham Vibecoders Unite!
LOCATION:Lolo's Boss Pizza: 21817 Northeast Halsey Street\, Fairview OR 9
 7024 US
SEQUENCE:1
END:VEVENT
